@startuml
' Discivium proposed local deployment

title Discivium - Proposed Local Deployment
left to right direction
skinparam nodeStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

node "Student or lecturer device" as Client {
  component "Web browser" as Browser
}

node "Local development machine" as Host {
  node "Django application process" as App {
    component "Discivium web application" as WebApp
  }

  database "SQLite database file" as Database
  folder "Local media storage" as Media
}

Browser --> WebApp : HTTP requests and HTML responses
WebApp --> Database : Django ORM reads and writes
WebApp --> Media : store and retrieve submission files

note right of Host
  First-release local prototype.
  Database files, uploaded files,
  credentials and environment files
  stay outside version control.
end note

cloud "Future hosted environment" as Future #DDDDDD {
  component "Hosted Django application" as HostedApp
  database "Managed database" as ManagedDb
  folder "Hosted media storage" as HostedMedia
}

Future ..> Host : later deployment option
HostedApp ..> ManagedDb : later database separation
HostedApp ..> HostedMedia : later media separation

legend right
  The future hosted environment is not required for the first release.
  Deployment choices must be verified by a clean setup rehearsal.
endlegend
@enduml
